		<label>dexedrine</label>
		<description>A refined form of amphetamine stimulant with drastically reduced side effects compared to Benzedrine. While it maintains a similar 24-hour window of physical enhancement and fatigue/hunger suppression, its addiction rate and tolerance accumulation are significantly lower. By neutralizing the psychoactive properties of the drug, it causes no mood swings during either its high or subsequent 'Crash' state. The severity of mental volatility and aggression during the crash is also strictly controlled, making it a much safer tactical option, though its efficacy in dulling pain is somewhat reduced.</description>
		<category>Item</category>

		<descriptionHyperlinks>
			<HediffDef>BD_DexedrineHigh</HediffDef>
