		<description>A modern, non-addictive eugeroic drug designed purely to suppress sleep. Upon ingestion, it moderately slows sleep and hunger depletion for 12 hours, providing virtually no boost to physical capacities nor any pain relief. Once the effect wears off, the pawn undergoes a mild 10-hour 'Crash' state characterized by minor physical deficits, increased sleep depletion, and a low chance of vomiting.\nWhile completely safe from chemical addiction, consecutive doses within a short window will build up a dedicated 'Modafinil Factor'; if this unique accumulation breaches the safety threshold of 8.5, the extreme strain on the cardiovascular system risks triggering a fatal heart attack.</description>
